<Base title="Colophon"><article class="simple-page shell"><p class="eyebrow">About this website</p><h1>A small, static notebook.</h1><p>This is the personal website of Khalil Ben Maaoui. The profile and professional experience are based on the CV provided for this site. Project descriptions follow the public repositories and distinguish working features from proposed extensions.</p><h2>Built to stay simple</h2><p>Astro generates static HTML from page components and Markdown. JavaScript is limited to the mobile navigation, article filtering, and the copy-link control. There are no accounts, analytics scripts, tracking cookies, or contact-form database.</p><h2>Illustrations</h2><p>The architecture and allocation-model illustrations were created with AI assistance from the project’s implementation. They are explanatory drawings. The example resource IDs are illustrative.</p><h2>Maintaining the notebook</h2><p>Articles live as Markdown files in the website repository. Adding a post and rebuilding updates the writing archive, homepage, RSS feed, and sitemap. The source is prepared for both root-domain hosting and a GitHub Pages project path.</p></article></Base>
